                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,56,'phrase','a wee discussion','a wee discussion = 稍微讨论一下 / 小小讨论一下','a wee discussion','稍微讨论一下；小小讨论一下','wee 在 NZ / Scottish / some British English 里很常见。',NULL,'wee discussion',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:09:51',1,'2026-04-04 16:09:51'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,57,'phrase','see how you guys get on','see how you guys get on = 看看你们做得怎么样','see how you guys get on','看看你们做得怎么样','get on 在这里指 do / manage / progress。',NULL,'get on',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:09:51',1,'2026-04-04 16:09:51'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,58,'sentence','It can help strengthen the muscles in your mouth...','It can help strengthen the muscles in your mouth, which can improve your pronunciation.
能加强你的口腔肌肉, 这将非常有利于自己的发音','It can help strengthen the muscles in your mouth, which can improve your pronunciation.','能加强你的口腔肌肉，这将非常有利于自己的发音。','适合讲发音训练。',NULL,'strengthen the muscles,pronunciation',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,59,'vocab','pharmacy technician','pharmacy technician = 药房技术员 / 药剂技术员，主要是协助药剂师','pharmacy technician','药房技术员 / 药剂技术员','主要协助药剂师。','She works as a pharmacy technician.
A pharmacy technician helped me at the counter.','pharmacy technician',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,60,'vocab','pharmacist','pharmacist = 药剂师，更高级的','pharmacist','药剂师','比 pharmacy technician 更高级。',NULL,'pharmacist',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29');
INSERT INTO english_note_item (note_id,item_order,item_type,item_title,raw_text,english_text,chinese_text,explanation,examples,keywords,share_status,priority_order,created_by,created_at,updated_by,updated_at) VALUES
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,61,'sentence','I started learning English when I was quite young...','I started learning English when I was quite young, about 10 years old. But back then, we mainly focused on reading, writing, and exams, so I didn’t get much chance to practise speaking. The last time I really studied English before recently was at university, when I studied it for about two years during my bachelor’s degree. After graduation, I had a long break and didn’t study English at all. Then, about four years ago, I started learning it again, but I mostly just memorised vocabulary and didn’t practise speaking very much.','I started learning English when I was quite young, about 10 years old. But back then, we mainly focused on reading, writing, and exams, so I didn’t get much chance to practise speaking. The last time I really studied English before recently was at university, when I studied it for about two years during my bachelor’s degree. After graduation, I had a long break and didn’t study English at all. Then, about four years ago, I started learning it again, but I mostly just memorised vocabulary and didn’t practise speaking very much.','我大概十岁时开始学英语。但那时候我们主要专注于阅读、写作和考试，所以我几乎没有机会练口语。最近之前，我上一次真正系统学英语是在大学本科期间，大概学了两年。毕业后我有很长一段时间完全没学。然后大概四年前，我又开始学了，但主要只是背单词，没有怎么练口语。','适合自我介绍、学习背景口语。',NULL,'started learning English,practise speaking',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,62,'sentence','Because AI technology has been advancing so quickly recently...','Because AI technology has been advancing so quickly recently, I think it’s bad news for software engineers. Even people without an AI background can now write code. I think this means the advantage software engineers used to have is smaller than before.','Because AI technology has been advancing so quickly recently, I think it’s bad news for software engineers. Even people without an AI background can now write code. I think this means the advantage software engineers used to have is smaller than before.','由于最近 AI 技术发展得很快，我觉得这对软件工程师来说是个坏消息。即使没有 AI 背景的人现在也能写代码。我觉得这意味着软件工程师过去拥有的优势比以前小了。','职业发展观点表达。',NULL,'AI technology,software engineers',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,63,'sentence','So the job market is quite tough.','So the job market is quite tough.','So the job market is quite tough.','所以就业市场挺艰难的。','简洁有力的总结句。',NULL,'job market',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,64,'sentence','I take the 820 bus to Lincoln University...','I take the 820 bus to Lincoln University. Actually, Rolleston isn’t very far away, but the bus doesn’t go directly there. It goes around the town, so it takes me about 40 minutes to get to school.','I take the 820 bus to Lincoln University. Actually, Rolleston isn’t very far away, but the bus doesn’t go directly there. It goes around the town, so it takes me about 40 minutes to get to school.','我坐 820 路公交去林肯大学。其实 Rolleston 不算远，但公交不是直达。它会绕镇子，所以我大概要花 40 分钟到学校。','通勤表达。',NULL,'820 bus,Lincoln University',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,65,'sentence','What we’re going to do now is this...','What we’re going to do now is this: I’m going to give each of you a question card. This will be a standing activity so that you can swap partners more easily. First, you’ll start with a different person from the one you were just with. After a few minutes, you’ll exchange your question cards with your partner, find a new partner, and continue the conversation using those questions.','What we’re going to do now is this: I’m going to give each of you a question card. This will be a standing activity so that you can swap partners more easily. First, you’ll start with a different person from the one you were just with. After a few minutes, you’ll exchange your question cards with your partner, find a new partner, and continue the conversation using those questions.','我们现在要做的是：我会给你们每人一张问题卡。这会是一个站着进行的活动，这样你们更容易交换搭档。首先，你们会和刚才不同的人开始。几分钟后，你们会和搭档交换问题卡，再找一个新搭档，继续用这些问题聊天。','课堂活动说明整句。',NULL,'question card,swap partners',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,66,'phrase','What we’re gonna do now is…','What we’re gonna do now is…
现在我们要做的是……','What we’re gonna do now is…','现在我们要做的是……','口语版活动说明开头。',NULL,'gonna do now',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,67,'phrase','exchange the questions','exchange the questions
交换问题卡','exchange the questions','交换问题卡','课堂活动表达。',NULL,'exchange the questions',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,68,'phrase','I really put you to work','I really put you to work 的意思是：
我真是让你忙起来了。
或者更自然一点：我真是让你干了不少活。','I really put you to work.','我真是让你忙起来了 / 我真让你干了不少活。','带一点抱歉和感谢的语气。','I really put you to work today.
Sorry, I really put you to work.','put you to work',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,69,'sentence','I study English outside class every day...','I study English outside class every day because there are only a few months left before I graduate. I need to prepare for future job interviews. On the one hand, I need to expand my vocabulary, including both everyday English and professional vocabulary. On another hand, I also practise speaking and listening to improve my communication skills, because I know I’ll face challenges in job interviews. So I feel quite worried about my future.','I study English outside class every day because there are only a few months left before I graduate. I need to prepare for future job interviews. On the one hand, I need to expand my vocabulary, including both everyday English and professional vocabulary. On another hand, I also practise speaking and listening to improve my communication skills, because I know I’ll face challenges in job interviews. So I feel quite worried about my future.','我每天在课外学英语，因为离毕业只剩几个月了。我需要为未来的求职面试做准备。一方面，我需要扩大词汇量，包括日常英语和专业词汇。另一方面，我也练习口语和听力来提高沟通能力，因为我知道求职面试中会遇到挑战。所以我对未来挺担心的。','学习计划和求职准备表达。',NULL,'outside class,job interviews',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,70,'phrase','serve customers','serve customers = 服务顾客
help customers = 帮助顾客','serve customers
help customers','服务顾客；帮助顾客','服务场景基础表达。',NULL,'serve customers,help customers',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29');
INSERT INTO english_note_item (note_id,item_order,item_type,item_title,raw_text,english_text,chinese_text,explanation,examples,keywords,share_status,priority_order,created_by,created_at,updated_by,updated_at) VALUES
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,71,'sentence','I have the opposite opinion to yours.','I have the opposite opinion to yours.
我有和你相反的想法','I have the opposite opinion to yours.','我有和你相反的想法。','礼貌表达不同意见。',NULL,'opposite opinion',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,72,'sentence','My partner asked me which I think is more difficult...','My partner asked me which I think is more difficult: vocabulary or grammar. I said vocabulary is more difficult for me because it feels almost unlimited, whereas grammar is more like a set of rules. Once you learn and remember the rules, you can apply them in real-life conversations. But vocabulary is much wider, so for me, vocabulary is harder.','My partner asked me which I think is more difficult: vocabulary or grammar. I said vocabulary is more difficult for me because it feels almost unlimited, whereas grammar is more like a set of rules. Once you learn and remember the rules, you can apply them in real-life conversations. But vocabulary is much wider, so for me, vocabulary is harder.','我的搭档问我词汇和语法哪个更难。我说词汇对我来说更难，因为它感觉几乎是无限的，而语法更像一套规则。一旦你学会并记住这些规则，就可以把它们应用到真实对话中。但词汇范围更广，所以对我来说词汇更难。','学习讨论表达。',NULL,'vocabulary,grammar',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,73,'phrase','pop in','Do you want to pop here ?
• go quickly
• come quickly
• drop by briefly
Can you pop in for a minute? 你能过来一下吗？','Can you pop in for a minute?','你能过来一下吗？','pop in / pop over 这类表达在 NZ / UK 口语里很自然。',NULL,'pop in',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,74,'phrase','be mindful of that','be mindful of that
= 注意这一点 / 对这一点很留意','be mindful of that','注意这一点；对这一点很留意','很适合表达自己在有意识调整某件事。',NULL,'mindful of that',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,75,'example','I try to be very mindful of that...','I try to be very mindful of that because I speak very fast.','I try to be very mindful of that because I speak very fast.','我会很注意这一点，因为我说得很快。','结合 mindful 的自然例句。',NULL,'mindful,speak very fast',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,76,'sentence','Sometimes I can understand what other people are saying...','Sometimes I can understand what other people are saying because of the situation or the context, but without those clues, it’s hard for me to understand what they mean.','Sometimes I can understand what other people are saying because of the situation or the context, but without those clues, it’s hard for me to understand what they mean.','有时候我能因为场景或上下文而听懂别人在说什么，但如果没有这些线索，我就很难理解他们的意思。','描述听力理解困难的自然表达。',NULL,'context,clues',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,77,'sentence','I think the best age for a child to learn another language...','I think the best age for a child to learn another language is around three or four years old, because they don’t feel much pressure when learning languages. They just imitate and copy what other people say. I think that’s a very natural process.','I think the best age for a child to learn another language is around three or four years old, because they don’t feel much pressure when learning languages. They just imitate and copy what other people say. I think that’s a very natural process.','我觉得孩子学另一门语言最好的年龄大概是三四岁，因为他们学语言时不会感觉太大压力。他们只是模仿和复制别人说的话。我觉得这是一个很自然的过程。','教育和语言学习话题表达。',NULL,'best age,learn another language',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,78,'phrase','It’s okay to learn whenever you want.','But I think it’s okay to learn whenever you want.
But I think it’s fine whenever you want to start.','But I think it’s okay to learn whenever you want.
But I think it’s fine whenever you want to start.','但我觉得你想什么时候学都可以。/ 你想什么时候开始都行。','鼓励性表达。',NULL,'whenever you want',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,79,'correction','I didn’t hear too much of our native language speaking through','I didn’t hear too much of our native language speaking through','I didn’t hear too much of our native language speaking through.','我没有听到太多我们母语的痕迹透出来。','原句略生硬，但大意是“没太听出母语口音/母语影响”。',NULL,'native language coming through',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   (1,80,'phrase','good work on that','good work on that = 这点做得不错','good work on that','这点做得不错。','反馈表达。',NULL,'good work on that',0,0,1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29',1,'2026-04-04 16:11:29');
