                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,74,'vocab','host','host','host','1. 主人，东道主。2. 主持人。3. 主办，举办。4. 主机，宿主。','host 既可作名词，也可作动词。计算机场景也很常见。','The host welcomed everyone. / He is the host of the show. / We will host a meeting tomorrow. / host server = 主机服务器','host,host a meeting,host server',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,75,'phrase','a small get-together','a small get-together','a small get-together','一个小聚会；小型聚一下。','非常自然的社交场景表达。','We''re having a small get-together this weekend. / It''s just a small get-together with a few friends.','get-together,small get-together',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,76,'phrase','run someone to and from ...','running my kids to and from …','run someone to and from ...','接送某人来回去……；开车送某人去某地再接回来。','口语里很常见，尤其用于家长接送孩子。to and from = 来回、往返。','I''m running my kids to and from school. / I spent the day running my kids to and from activities.','to and from,run my kids,school run',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
