                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,78,'phrase','take it in for maintenance','Take it in for maintenance','take it in for maintenance','把它送去做保养；把它拿去维修保养。','车、设备、机器等场景都很常见。','I need to take my car in for maintenance. / We should take it in for maintenance next week.','maintenance,take it in',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
