                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,84,'phrase','a bunch of','a bunch of','a bunch of','一堆；一群；很多。','比 many / a lot of 更口语、更随意。有时也保留“一束、一串”的字面意思。','a bunch of flowers / a bunch of keys / a bunch of books / a bunch of kids / a bunch of grapes','a bunch of',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,85,'sentence','fortunate to secure an internship through the program','fortunate to secure an internship through the program','fortunate to secure an internship through the program','很幸运能通过这个项目拿到一份实习。','fortunate = 幸运的；secure = 获得、拿到；through the program = 通过这个项目。','fortunate to secure an internship through the program','secure an internship,through the program,fortunate',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
