                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,88,'phrase','from ... to ... to ...','from … to … to …','from ... to ... to ...','从……到……再到……','用来列举多个阶段、多个方面或多个任务，表达很清晰。','from knowing what to focus on, to building the right skills, to preparing for interviews','from to to,listing',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,89,'phrase','what to focus on','what to focus on','what to focus on','该重点关注什么。','学习、工作、计划安排时都很常用。','I didn''t know what to focus on. / It''s important to know what to focus on first.','what to focus on,focus on',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
