                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,103,'vocab','shutter blade','shutter blade','shutter blade','快门叶片。','常见于相机、镜头内部快门、某些机械装置里的叶片式快门。','shutter = 快门；blade = 叶片','shutter blade,shutter,camera',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,104,'vocab','extreme','extreme','extreme','极端的；非常强烈的；极度的；极端情况。','extreme 可作形容词，也可作名词（常见复数 extremes）。常见搭配有 extreme weather, extreme pain, extreme views, go to extremes, a bit extreme。','extreme weather / extreme pain / extreme views / He goes to extremes when he diets. / That sounds a bit extreme.','extreme,extremes,go to extremes',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,105,'vocab','biography / autobiography / bibliography','biography / autobiography / bibliography','biography / autobiography / bibliography','biography = 传记；autobiography = 自传；bibliography = 参考文献。','这三个词很容易混淆。','biography / autobiography / bibliography','biography,autobiography,bibliography',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (2,106,'phrase','inspire me','inspire me','inspire me','激励我；启发我；给我灵感。','inspire 比单纯的 encourage 更强，常带“被打动、被鼓舞、被启发”的感觉。','You inspire me. / Your story inspires me. / This painting inspires me.','inspire me,inspire',0,0,1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04',1,'2026-04-05 07:44:04'),
